  "goodToKnow": "Die Gymnastik means exercises or gymnastics: Morgengymnastik (morning exercises), Rückengymnastik (exercises for a healthy back). It usually means simple fitness exercises, not Olympic gymnastics, which is Turnen. Gymnastik classes for older people are hugely popular in German sports clubs (Sportvereine). The word goes back to Greek gymnos, 'naked', because Greek athletes trained unclothed."
